OL,3,GNEWSACompany boss who sold #500k of
OL,4,Aillegal medical devices sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA company director who sold #500,000 of
OL,7,Fillegal medical devices has been given
OL,8,Fa three-year suspended jail sentence.
OL,10,FKenneth Harrison co-founded Medicina
OL,11,FLtd, a legitimate company selling
OL,12,Fmedical goods, in 1991 but over the
OL,13,Fyears began to regard proper testing
OL,14,Fand certification as merely "red tape"
OL,15,Fand an inconvenience, a court heard.
OL,17,FManchester Crown Court was told he had
OL,18,Falso encouraged his staff to cover up
OL,19,Fhis dishonesty by selling goods with
OL,20,Ffalse safety approval markings.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
