OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 70-year-old, from Bolton, Greater
OL,7,FManchester, was convicted of five fraud
OL,8,Foffences between 2010 and 2014,
OL,9,Ffollowing a 10-week trial earlier this
OL,10,Fyear.
